> Original video observations

Use the same24/6/6 genuine KTH clips as C3D and I3D:boxing0,handclapping1,
handwaving2;scenario1,people1..4 fitting,5 validation,6 held out. Original
annotations supply the first two segments per video;16unique original frames
span each segment. These selected observations are not necessarily adjacent
in the recording. FFmpeg decodes only;Float32 tensor bilinear resize32px and
/255 produce RGB. The original-video mirror is pinned to
7076149bdbeff8d70003a68d6291fd080db44683 because the official server was unavailable.
Source hashes,annotations,person/video/segment IDs and selected frame IDs remain
in the preparation manifest. This is a custom tiny subset,not a benchmark split.

```{cpp, flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
  const std::filesystem::path cache = dm::datasets::data_home();
  dm::datasets::prepare_example_data("video", (cache / "action_video").string());
}
```
