Recorded evaluation 1: 6 observations; accuracy 0.333333.
\image(figures/slowfast_confusion_api_0.svg)
// result_end
\caption(Annotated confusion matrix from the recorded learned SlowFast predictions. Every cell is labeled; true classes run top to bottom.)
\alttext(Exact recorded true-row predicted-column counts rendered by the confusion-matrix SVG API.)

> Conclusion

Original observations,all32bottlenecks,four fusions and complete held-out results remain inspectable. Independent fusion derivatives and zero-gate checks validate the mechanism;inference interventions test information transfer without implying benchmark action accuracy.

> References

- [Feichtenhofer et al.(2019),SlowFast Networks for Video Recognition](https://arxiv.org/abs/1812.03982).
- [Original KTH action data](https://www.csc.kth.se/cvap/actions/).
- [Pinned original-video mirror](https://huggingface.co/datasets/AtharvaPote/KTH-Action-Recognition-mirror/tree/7076149bdbeff8d70003a68d6291fd080db44683).
